PharmOmics app2 Instructions
1.	Run SCING and wKDA (optional)
2.	Download the following directory:

3.	Modify paths and run: (optional)
 	“Prepare_APP2_human_genes.R”
-	This creates genes files to input into PharmOmics from your wKDA results

4.	Modify and run: (optional)
“Prepare_SCING_network_human.R”
-	This creates the SCING network file you will need for the next step based on SCING output

5.	Modify and run:
“app2_seg_prepare_interactive.R”
-	This creates a network file based on your genes files that app2 needs to run

6.	Modify and run:
“app2_seg_run_interactive.R”
-	This runs app2 and makes 14 output files

7.	Modify and run:
“Merge_results_app2_seg_run_interactive.R”
-	This merges, ranks app2 results and prepares them for output in one file
